& [Purpose]
  + form SWA-04A as a pure provider-free handoff from one exact ready SWA-03 attempt and one supplied prior Phase3A admission to one bounded update proposal
  + prove supplied-form integrity causal correspondence path bounds and deterministic identity while leaving present freshness and every physical action unresolved

& [ProfilesAndInput]
  + [UHA-001] profiles are cantor-self-work-update-handoff-request/0.1 and cantor-self-work-update-handoff-proposal/0.1 with closed deterministic JSON
  + [UHA-002] request embeds and revalidates the complete exact SelfWorkLifecycleRequest and current SelfWorkLifecycleCheckpoint
  + [UHA-003] selected step appears exactly once in the checkpoint as ready_awaiting_admission and retains its exact current attempt identity
  + [UHA-004] lifecycle request digest checkpoint digest sequence step attempt objective plan authority and session lineage correspond exactly
  + [UHA-005] request embeds one complete prior CandidateWorkspaceRequest and AdmissionReceipt without acquiring the workspace again

& [SuppliedAdmissionIntegrity]
  + [UHA-006] a pure claim-prefix validator preserves the existing Phase3A profile UUID nonce digest object branch budget set and lexical allowed-path fault order before any physical path validation
  + [UHA-007] request_sha256 rederives from the complete supplied CandidateWorkspaceRequest through the existing exact canonical JSON and SHA-256 grammar
  + [UHA-008] receipt_sha256 rederives from the existing receipt body excluding itself and every request-to-receipt identity fact is exact
  + [UHA-009] receipt profile admitted true observation digest resource account paths Git identity base branch and allowlist are structurally valid and complete
  + [UHA-010] self-consistent supplied admission evidence is not authenticated current or fresh; disposition remains prepared_awaiting_physical_revalidation

& [UpdateProposal]
  + [UHA-011] one through 64 ProposedPathChange values are strictly sorted by unique canonical relative path and every path exactly equals one admitted allowed_relative_path
  + [UHA-012] change kinds reuse current cantor-phase3-machine-forms/0.2 CandidateChangeKind and historical 0.1 is refused
  + [UHA-013] add has no expected base plus desired content and desired mode; modify has distinct expected and desired content plus desired mode; delete has expected base only; mode_change has equal expected and desired content plus a desired mode
  + [UHA-014] every expected or desired content identity is canonical sha256 and desired mode is exactly 100644 or 100755
  + [UHA-015] proposal binds handoff identity workspace correlation candidate base branch exact change set evidence unresolved account verification obligations and quarantine_without_cleanup fault disposition

& [AuthorityDigestAndFaults]
  + [UHA-016] evidence is nonempty bounded sorted and unique and unresolved account explicitly retains physical freshness mutation verification acceptance rollback cleanup commit push and succeeding-SOP authority
  + [UHA-017] authority is representation_only disposition is prepared_awaiting_physical_revalidation and the exact nonauthority statement denies every physical or later-stage claim
  + [UHA-018] request and proposal digests are domain-separated SHA-256 over complete self-excluding canonical forms and equal validation replays byte-identically
  + [UHA-019] profile lifecycle state workspace claim admission receipt path change evidence bound authority correspondence digest and machine-form faults are typed
  + [UHA-020] unknown fields stale checkpoint nonready step attempt substitution malformed or forged receipt path widening change-shape substitution authority laundering and digest mutation refuse atomically

& [Acceptance]
  + [UHA-A01] source audit SJS input audit canonical explosion review signature plan matrix and phase lock bind exactly
  + [UHA-A02] positive fixtures cover supplied-admission integrity every change shape multiple sorted paths exact lifecycle selection and deterministic replay
  + [UHA-A03] adversarial fixtures refuse lifecycle checkpoint state attempt request receipt digest field path allowlist ordering change profile content mode evidence nonauthority output and machine-form substitution
  + [UHA-A04] focused debug release lint format workspace evidence attribution publication and post-push replay gates pass

& [Delineation]
  + pure claim-prefix extraction supplied request and receipt integrity lifecycle correspondence proposed change shape path allowlist deterministic proposal identity and machine forms are inside
  + filesystem or executable observation present freshness Phase3A receipt issuance App Server process workspace mutation verification acceptance rollback cleanup commit push provider effects SOP authorship signature activation persistence remote FPGA and Minecraft are outside

